{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps","id":158992,"title":"Maps and cake! (but mostly maps)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-06-04T07:22:42-07:00","id":158992,"title":"Maps and cake! (but mostly maps)","content":"I like maps.<br /> <br /> It isn't a secret for anyone here that I love maps, and like making and perusing them. Before the forum change, I had opened up a thread where people would ask me to make maps for their games, and I'd try do do something nice for them.<br /> <br /> After that, my computer crashed and burned, and I had a bit of trouble re-installing photoshop on it (and then my tablet stopped working and I moved around the world for a year or so) so I stopped.<br /> <br /> I'm back in France now. Photoshop is working, I have a brand new tablet : it's time to make maps again. Here is most of what I've done on a computer (you can click on the images to get the link to the deviantart picture) :<br /> <br /> Maruba, the universe of the Desert at the Center of the World.<br /> <a href=\"http://tipexleloup.deviantart.com/art/Carte-de-Maruba-438826769?q=gallery%3Atipexleloup%2F8976999&amp;qo=0\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://th07.deviantart.net/fs70/200H/i/2014/066/0/d/carte_de_maruba_by_tipexleloup-d799kwh.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a><br /> <br /> The Pillars of the Sky, a weird area in the southeast of Creation<br /> <a href=\"http://tipexleloup.deviantart.com/art/The-Pillars-of-the-Sky-363652281?q=gallery%3Atipexleloup%2F8976999&amp;qo=1\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://th07.deviantart.net/fs70/200H/i/2013/095/e/7/the_pillars_of_the_sky_by_tipexleloup-d60ibw9.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a><br /> <br /> The South-West Cadran, done for an Exalted campaign<br /> <a href=\"http://tipexleloup.deviantart.com/art/Map-of-Amata-205374472?q=gallery%3Atipexleloup%2F8976999&amp;qo=12\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://th04.deviantart.net/fs70/200H/i/2011/108/8/3/map_of_amata_by_tipexleloup-d3e9vyg.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":21}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-04T07:23:18-07:00","id":159012,"title":"","content":"A few archipelagoes<br /> <a href=\"http://tipexleloup.deviantart.com/art/Les-Jumelles-343268080?q=gallery%3Atipexleloup%2F8976999&amp;qo=3\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://th03.deviantart.net/fs71/200H/i/2012/351/7/0/les_jumelles_by_tipexleloup-d5odfcg.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a> <a href=\"http://tipexleloup.deviantart.com/art/Archipelago-details-343267486?q=gallery%3Atipexleloup%2F8976999&amp;qo=4\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://th02.deviantart.net/fs70/200H/i/2