rt <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-04T12:12:38-07:00","id":159275,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/15u0teea80qd8dz/belicht_scan.png\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.dropbox.com/s/15u0teea80...licht_scan.png</a> Slightly better scan of the map.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/37-dionysus","name":"Dionysus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar37_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-07T06:09:31-07:00","id":161603,"title":"","content":"If it is at all possible i always wanted a map of creation that was expanded because after over a decade of playing both 1st &amp; 2nd edition Exalted my troupe have visited just about every place their is in canon &amp; i always felt the map was a bit small. We have created our own towns &amp; cities that we use in our games but never had a map to support it visually.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If you think nobody cares if you're alive, try missing a couple of payments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2890-walker-of-ebony-clouds","name":"Walker-of-Ebony-Clouds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-07T11:29:08-07:00","id":161879,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Walker-of-Ebony-Clouds</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=161603#post161603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If it is at all possible i always wanted a map of creation that was expanded because after over a decade of playing both 1st &amp; 2nd edition Exalted my troupe have visited just about every place their is in canon &amp; i always felt the map was a bit small. We have created our own towns &amp; cities that we use in our games but never had a map to support it visually.</div> </div> </div> </div>Isn't most of the map empty space in which you can pop down kingdoms the size of France without impinging on anyone important?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-07T13:03:52-07:00","id":161944,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=161879#post161879\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Isn't most of the map empty space in which you can pop down kingdoms the size of France without impinging on anyone important?</div> </div> </div> </div>Absolutely. Also...<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Walker-of-Ebony-Clouds</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=161603#post161603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If it is at all possible i always wanted a map of creation that was expanded because after over a decade of playing both 1st &amp; 2nd edition Exalted my troupe have visited just about every place their is in canon &amp; i always felt the map was a bit small. We have created our own towns &amp; cities that we use in our games but never had a map to support it visually.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is an incredible amount of work. Not something I would attempt so close to the release of Ex3 and a brand new map, and probably not even without that in mind. Sorry!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-10T10:58:10-07:00","id":164954,"title":"","content":"And there we go! Belicht, the country of Eternal Autumn!<br /> <a href=\"http://tipexleloup.deviantart.com/art/Belicht-459892866\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://th01.deviantart.net/fs71/200H/i/2014/162/1/b/belicht_by_tipexleloup-d7lt3lu.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a><br /> <br /> You can go download it in full resolution on the deviantart page (just click on the image here, and then click the download icon on the right). If you see anything you'd need me to change, just say the word!<br /> <br /> Edit : changed two spelling mistakes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":541,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","user":"LeTipex","date":". 08-04-2014, 07:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-10T15:18:39-07:00","id":165281,"title":"","content":"How cool is that! That's bloody awesome. Thank you <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/37-dionysus","name":"Dionysus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar37_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"104"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-10T18:56:08-07:00","id":165485,"title":"","content":"can you help me draw my exalted map?, i ended with a pentadimensional (or hexadimensional, i dont really know) world that i have no idea how to draw","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/278-elyon","name":"Elyon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar278_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"149"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T05:15:02-07:00","id":165813,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dionysus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=165281#post165281\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How cool is that! That's bloody awesome. Thank you <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Always happy to help! I'm really glad you like it, it was a bit of an experiment for me.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elyon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=165485#post165485\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">can you help me draw my exalted map?, i ended with a pentadimensional (or hexadimensional, i dont really know) world that i have no idea how to draw</div> </div> </div> </div>Now that's a challenge! Could you give me a few more details before I decide whether to embark myself on such an epic endeavour?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-04T04:23:15-07:00","id":218013,"title":"","content":"Bumping this thread for two reasons: <br /> 1. I bring new maps!<br /> The Ashford Valley, a diegetic map of a locale for a DnD game.<br /> <a href=\"http://tipexleloup.deviantart.com/art/Ashford-Valley-444485008\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://th04.deviantart.net/fs71/200H/i/2014/214/e/6/ashford_valley_by_tipexleloup-d7cmuts.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a><br /> <br /> The Sea of Clouds, a pseudo-XIXth century european fantasy setting, a continent floating on (appropriately enough) a sea of clouds and vapor.<br /> <a href=\"http://tipexleloup.deviantart.com/art/The-Sea-of-Clouds-466383430\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://th04.deviantart.net/fs70/200H/i/2014/189/2/6/the_sea_of_clouds_by_tipexleloup-d7po7ra.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a><br /> <br /> And something I rarely do : a city map, the Kindgom City of Ro'An.<br /> <a href=\"http://tipexleloup.deviantart.com/art/The-Kingdom-City-of-Ro-An-472552699\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://th03.deviantart.net/fs70/200H/i/2014/216/1/1/the_kingdom_city_of_ro_an_by_tipexleloup-d7tcfzv.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a><br /> <br /> As always, click on the image, get to the deviantart page, etc...<br /> <br /> 2. Eric Minton mentionned his interest in the ongoing thread I have on rpgnet, and I told him I'd gladly do a map for his playtest game. Eric, give me more info, and I'll do what I can! More shiniez Ex3 fun!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-04T06:54:53-07:00","id":218114,"title":"","content":"Your maps are really great and I kind of admire them.<br /> <br /> So! This is a request: would you be interested in drawing a map of the <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/14MUmj8guEXo78GgZJc_eXQhtx7aEZRe91gc5pVyjyYs/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Eye of the North?</a> A river valley in (appropriately enough) the shape of an eye... in the Underworld!<br /> <br /> If so, thanks a lot, and I'm here for any further information you might need on what the place is like.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-04T08:13:02-07:00","id":218183,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omicron</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=218114#post218114\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Your maps are really great and I kind of admire them.<br /> <br /> So! This is a request: would you be interested in drawing a map of the <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/14MUmj8guEXo78GgZJc_eXQhtx7aEZRe91gc5pVyjyYs/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Eye of the North?</a> A river valley in (appropriately enough) the shape of an eye... in the Underworld!<br /> <br /> If so, thanks a lot, and I'm here for any further information you might need on what the place is like.</div> </div> </div> </div>Being quite a fan myself of most of what you post here, I can only say yes to that.<br /> <br /> Although I'm really tempted to add more... Hmm... <i>&quot;Yes, Omicron... Join me! With our powers combined, no one will be able to stand in our way! Let us rule Creation together, as artist and writer!&quot;</i><br /> <br /> (I can't help it : I'm pretty proud of myself for showcasing so many cliches in a single line...)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-04T09:41:31-07:00","id":218273,"title":"","content":"These are great, Tipex! Totally borrowing these for my Ex3 game. If you ever feel like doing a map of that coastal mountains area between An Teng and The Lap, let me know! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/680-adarael","name":"Adarael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar680_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-05T04:54:51-07:00","id":218955,"title":"","content":"Wow, that is way cool! If you are still taking requests, i have one (i could even send you a continental shape, if you want). So here goes (it's mainly the basic ideas for the setting in question...but hopefully that sounds inspiring enough for you to want to do the map <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ) :<br /> <br /> You take the oddest bits of the Old Testament, stir in various secondary material from all three Abrahamic religions and you have one of the weirdest and wooliest sword-and-sorcery settings around<br /> * Sophisticated, but scattered civilizations<br /> * Wildernesses full of every cool prehistoric critter of every era<br /> * Centuries-old patriarchs - drop by the right place, and you can meet the very first man<br /> * Mysterious wandering deities. You can't tell them apart, you can only take them at their word when they say they're your old benefactor. However, while quite powerful, they're less than omniscient.<br /> * The beautiful and awful servants of at least one of those deities<br /> * Giants and other fabulous hybrids of humans and some of those servants<br /> * Strange and wretched once-humans cursed by those deities, who've gained vast power that they often use against humanity","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/153-ebon-wolf","name":"Ebon Wolf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar153_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-05T09:31:15-07:00","id":219189,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LeTipex</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=218013#post218013\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2. Eric Minton mentionned his interest in the ongoing thread I have on rpgnet, and I told him I'd gladly do a map for his playtest game. Eric, give me more info, and I'll do what I can! More shiniez Ex3 fun!</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! I need some time to pull the info together (and to give names to a bunch of city-states), but I'll be sure to get it to you when time and EX3 allow.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted.<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1120-eric-minton","name":"Eric Minton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2000"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-23T11:48:18-07:00","id":238404,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Adarael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=218273#post218273\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">These are great, Tipex! Totally borrowing these for my Ex3 game. If you ever feel like doing a map of that coastal mountains area between An Teng and The Lap, let me know! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Will do!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ebon Wolf</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=218955#post218955\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wow, that is way cool! If you are still taking requests, i have one (i could even send you a continental shape, if you want). So here goes (it's mainly the basic ideas for the setting in question...but hopefully that sounds inspiring enough for you to want to do the map)</div> </div> </div> </div>I sent you a pm. I might do it in a while, once I've cleared some of my backlog!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eric Minton</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=219189#post219189\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks! I need some time to pull the info together (and to give names to a bunch of city-states), but I'll be sure to get it to you when time and EX3 allow.</div> </div> </div> </div>No worries! Take your time. I'll be glad to do it once you send me the info about it.<br /> <br /> And now, let us explore Omicron's Underworld with a map of The Eye of the North!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://tipexleloup.deviantart.com/art/The-Eye-of-the-North-477611138\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://th06.deviantart.net/fs70/200H/i/2014/235/5/7/the_eye_of_the_north_by_tipexleloup-d7wcv42.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":541,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","user":"LeTipex","date":". 08-23-2014, 03:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-23T12:18:05-07:00","id":238418,"title":"","content":"Ooooh yeah, this is the good stuff. <br /> <br /> I particularly like the addition of the little city sketches in the corners. Perfect way to make the depiction of the region more vibrant without getting into the complexity of actual city maps. Also it's all really pretty.<br /> <br /> Stellar work, LeTipex! I'm glad I asked you n_n","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-12T03:59:55-07:00","id":278718,"title":"","content":"The setting of my next campaign (Chains of Silver and Blood), that will start once 3e comes out. Based around Dir-Jal, the city of the Chained God.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://tipexleloup.deviantart.com/art/Dir-Jal-the-City-of-the-Chained-God-487739476\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://th05.deviantart.net/fs71/200H/i/2014/284/9/0/dir_jal___the_city_of_the_chained_god_by_tipexleloup-d82dy6s.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-12T04:25:40-07:00","id":278737,"title":"","content":"The red color kinda weirds me out (I keep seeing it as some kind of tainted area where the earth is red like blood) but it looks damn cool!<br /> <br /> I have a fondness for the concept of the &quot;chained behemoth city.&quot; It's been described to me before, but I never saw one fully realized. I'd love to hear more about Dir-Jal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-12T07:07:45-07:00","id":278785,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omicron</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=278737#post278737\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The red color kinda weirds me out (I keep seeing it as some kind of tainted area where the earth is red like blood) but it looks damn cool!<br /> <br /> I have a fondness for the concept of the &quot;chained behemoth city.&quot; It's been described to me before, but I never saw one fully realized. I'd love to hear more about Dir-Jal.</div> </div> </div> </div>Here's <a href=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/56756168/Chains%20of%20Silver%20and%20Blood.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">a link to the doc</a> I made for my players on the campaign area. It's mostly a mishmash of stuff I posted on the forum over time (I think the original text for Dir-Jal is still on the copy-paste Archive thread), and a few things from the Plot Garden (the river children and the dreaming pearls are pretty much lifted from one of Semicasual's posts)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-12T07:37:59-07:00","id":278799,"title":"","content":"Damn - I wish I had a place in mind for you to make a map, cake, or map-cake of.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-12T23:29:36-07:00","id":279416,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LeTipex</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=159014#post159014\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>So, what is that all about? Well, I'm open for new requests! Anyone who has an idea of a map that he wants me to make can ask me for it. </b>There are a few caveats, though :<br /> - those aren't commisions, which means you don't have to pay me, but keep in mind I also do it to experiment : the style may sometimes change at time as I try out new stuff.<br /> - I'm not sure I'll do city maps. They can really be time-consuming, so you can ask for them, but there is less chance of me responding in the positive. I'm not saying I won't do any, just that it's harder.<br /> - I'll try to finish any map I'll start, barring further computer issues.<br /> - I'm not doing any cake maps for you. Unless you also want to come and eat the cake, in which case, sure, I'll do them.<br /> <br /> So, what parts of Creation (or beyond) do you want me to map out for you?</div> </div> </div> </div>Would you be willing to do a map of an <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/263386-shard-variation-air\">entire alternate Creation</a>? I've started a game set in that Shard, y'see, and I feel like it'd do a lot to make things 'pop' out at my players. I am willing to proffer setting writeups or 'custom fiction' in repayment!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I\u00e4! I\u00e4! Moe fthagn!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/280-valles","name":"Valles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar280_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"677"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-13T03:47:39-07:00","id":279489,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Valles</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=279416#post279416\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Would you be willing to do a map of an <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/263386-shard-variation-air\">entire alternate Creation</a>? I've started a game set in that Shard, y'see, and I feel like it'd do a lot to make things 'pop' out at my players. I am willing to proffer setting writeups or 'custom fiction' in repayment!</div> </div> </div> </div>That is an ambitious project. Let me think about it!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-13T08:18:34-07:00","id":279637,"title":"","content":"Actually, do you think you could map a smallish island? I've got a Western game going (mostly freeforming it for now), and the PCs are about to get a pirate's map with the Isle of the Three Dragons on it. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">The Three Dragons were an infamous trio of pirates in the Shogunate, though whether they were Dragon-Blooded, Dragon Kings, elementals, or something stranger is a detail lost to history. This island was their secret lair, and is now (unbeknownst to anybody) their grave.<br /> <br /> The most important feature of the island is its manse, which takes the form of a hidden treasure-cave, guarded by bound demons. Said cave also has an underwater entrance - the Three Dragons used sorcery to sink their ship, guide it to the secret entrance, and then bring it to the surface inside.<br /> <br /> The island itself, a tiny thing (perhaps a mile and a half wide), is considered haunted by sailors, and thus they give it a wide berth - the demons will generally kill intruders.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-13T10:19:37-07:00","id":279828,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LeTipex</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=279489#post279489\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That is an ambitious project. Let me think about it!</div> </div> </div> </div>Better than the &quot;No, I'm not willing to dive into <i>that</i>&quot; that I was expecting. Thanks for considering it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I\u00e4! I\u00e4! Moe fthagn!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/280-valles","name":"Valles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar280_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"677"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-24T13:40:40-08:00","id":773388,"title":"","content":"So, I noticed that you still had a link to this in your signature. Are you still interested in doing maps for people?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T10:36:46-08:00","id":774900,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=773388#post773388\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, I noticed that you still had a link to this in your signature. Are you still interested in doing maps for people?</div> </div> </div> </div>I am. In fact, I'm doing one for TheMG right now, I should post it this week-end.<br /> <br /> Also : necro-ing a thread without propers incantations of respect towards the Neverborn? Shame, BrillantRain.<br /> <br /> So : &quot;Rise, rise, thread, from your ashes and the dust of your bones, from you dead pixels and the depth of this forum. I offer you blood and soul and jpeg artifacts, and the cyber-soul of the insolent Brillant Rain in tribute, oh Great Devourer! May the mods turn their eyes from you in awe!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T15:19:54-08:00","id":775058,"title":"","content":"Sorry. And thank you for doing these.<br /> <br /> If you have time in a few weeks, I would be interested in discussing some maps for me.<br /> <br /> Provided the Neverborn don't eat my soul anyway.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T18:18:40-08:00","id":775131,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LeTipex</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=774900#post774900\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In fact, I'm doing one for TheMG right now, I should post it this week-end.</div> </div> </div> </div><img src=\"http://img.pandawhale.com/post-53389-captain-holt-hot-damn-gif-Imgu-xwh7.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-28T11:15:59-08:00","id":776109,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=775058#post775058\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry. And thank you for doing these.<br /> <br /> If you have time in a few weeks, I would be interested in discussing some maps for me.<br /> <br /> Provided the Neverborn don't eat my soul anyway.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okey doke! Sending you a pm!<br /> <br /> The MG, here are the Seven Isles!<br /> <a href=\"http://tipexleloup.deviantart.com/art/The-Seven-Isles-574986508\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://img04.deviantart.net/0aa3/i/2015/332/8/5/the_seven_isles_by_tipexleloup-d9ibyfg.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a><br /> As usual, click on the picture to see it in deviantart and download the full version!<br /> <br /> As I said above, I'm re-starting this thread, so if people want a map, post here to ask about it! (Since it's been so long, I assume most of what people have asked a year or two ago isn't still relevant, until they ask it again.) I'm currently doing one for my own game, plus one for Raemus and probably Brillant Rain, and work and life tend to conspire not to leave me much time to do artwork,so I won't be taking a dozen commands at a time (I tried doing that and pretty much burned out once)<br /> <br /> But two or three is plenty fine!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>U