nkedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-04T06:38:31-08:00","id":779759,"title":"","content":"Would you be willing to do a map of the Neck with the islands labeled and tribal &quot;zones of influence&quot; demarcated?<br /> <br /> A map of Solid Shell in particular would also be nice. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-04T09:00:56-08:00","id":779852,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=779759#post779759\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Would you be willing to do a map of the Neck with the islands labeled and tribal &quot;zones of influence&quot; demarcated?<br /> <br /> A map of Solid Shell in particular would also be nice. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Sure! Don't know much about the Neck tho... What's Solid Shell?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-04T16:32:22-08:00","id":780220,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LeTipex</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=779852#post779852\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sure! Don't know much about the Neck tho... What's Solid Shell?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's the only proper city in the Neck, on the largest island, Amphiro. My players keep accidentally referring to it as a &quot;town.&quot; -_-","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-04T17:00:55-08:00","id":780234,"title":"","content":"Have you done anything on a slightly smaller scale than giant world map? I'm running a game in Port Calin, situated just north of Lookshy. The nation stretches from the inland sea to the eastern river, from the southern over to Marin Bay in the north. Major centers include Port Calin on the southern coast, Good Harbor also on the coast but further east, Centak in the south east, and Kimihurne up north by Sijan on the east coast. It's mostly fertile farmland, but there are large forests and logging north of Port Calin and mines near Centak, including a millennia-old, unused gold mine. The inland is mostly rural farmland. The whole area is approximately the size of the US state Texas, or friggin' enormous. I picture it a lot like the American Midwest, wild, fertile, rolling country with lots of farms and forests and tiny villages everywhere.<br /> <br /> Any details or flourishes will just be utilized, since it's a pretty blank slate still. Any names of towns or cities will used. Feel free to change names too, I'm not attached to them. Just go nuts, basically.<br /> <br /> Or don't. I'd expect every forum its to clamor for your work, right along with Jen's character thread that blew up in epic fashion.<br /> <br /> Edit: I'm using this map for reference so far. <a href=\"http://www.oakthorne.net/pics/wiki/exalted/scavengerlands-map-overview.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.oakthorne.net/pics/wiki/e...p-overview.jpg</a><br /> <br /> Edit edit: Oh holy shit, this thread is old as hell. Well, I'll just be on my way unless you really feel like another map request. lol","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Don't feel bad. People tell the developers they get Exalted wrong all the time. -hippokrene","edited":{"userid":4729,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4729-childofthesun1","user":"Childofthesun1","date":". 12-05-2015, 11:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4729-childofthesun1","name":"Childofthesun1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4729_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"853"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-05T03:30:11-08:00","id":780477,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=780220#post780220\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's the only proper city in the Neck, on the largest island, Amphiro. My players keep accidentally referring to it as a &quot;town.&quot; -_-</div> </div> </div> </div>Why not! Send me a pm!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Childofthesun1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=780234#post780234\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Edit edit: Oh holy shit, this Thad is old as hell. Well, I'll just be on my way unless you really feel like another map request. lol</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, it's been reactivated.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Childofthesun1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=780234#post780234\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Have you done anything on a slightly smaller scale than giant world map?</div> </div> </div> </div>Most of my map are only small areas and occasionnaly cities, so yeah!<br /> <br /> [QUOTE=Childofthesun1;n780234]I'm running a game in Port Calin, situated just north of Lookshy. The nation stretches from the inland sea to the eastern river, from the southern over to Marin Bay in the north. Major centers include Port Calin on the southern coast, Good Harbor also on the coast but further east, Centak in the south east, and Kimihurne up north by Sijan on the east coast. It's mostly fertile farmland, but there are large forests and logging north of Port Calin and mines near Centak, including a millennia-old, unused gold mine. The inland is mostly rural farmland. The whole area is approximately the size of the US state Texas, or friggin' enormous. I picture it a lot like the American Midwest, wild, fertile, rolling country with lots of farms and forests and tiny villages everywhere.<br /> <br /> Any details or flourishes will just be utilized, since it's a pretty blank slate still. Any names of towns or cities will used. Feel free to change names too, I'm not attached to them. Just go nuts, basically.<br /> <br /> Or don't. I'd expect every forum its to clamor for your work, right along with Jen's character thread that blew up in epic fashion.<br /> <br /> Edit: I'm using this map for reference so far. <a href=\"http://www.oakthorne.net/pics/wiki/exalted/scavengerlands-map-overview.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.oakthorne.net/pics/wiki/e...p-overview.jpg</a><br /> Might be interested. Send me a pm?<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-05T04:13:29-08:00","id":780490,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LeTipex</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=165813#post165813\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Always happy to help! I'm really glad you like it, it was a bit of an experiment for me.<br /> <br /> <br /> Now that's a challenge! Could you give me a few more details before I decide whether to embark myself on such an epic endeavour?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Sorry for my delay, college is hard to handle.<br /> <br /> ok, my map is a bit like this:<br /> <br /> The world is no longer flat, the elemental poles are enough powerfull to wipe the wyld and create a sort of bubble dimension.<br /> <br /> Every Elemental pole is still a pillar of elemental manifestation, but, every elemental pole is conected to the other 4 through land, but those lands are not conected between them, in example, the elemental pole of fire is conected to the elemental pole of earth through land, that, close to each pole, have the manifestations of those poles, but at the point where they merge, multielemental manifestations appear on the land, like magma rivers and such. This earth-fire connection is not connected to the water-fire connection, or the wood-wind connection, if you want to go, lets say, from wood- earth to water-fire, you need to go first to the wood elemental pole or the earth elemental pole, and then travel to the water or fire elemental pole, and then go to the water-fire destination.<br /> <br /> If you start climbing the pillars of energy that are the elemental poles, you will end getting to the base after certain time.<br /> <br /> Connective earth details: those conective lands are not dimensionally flat, those are cilindric, so if you walk through the upper edge, you will end in the lower edge.<br /> <br /> Elemental poles details: Each elemental power is a pillar of elemental essence without beggining or end, and around them, the air and land have the manifestations of the elemental energies: The elemental pole of wood have forest and jungles climbing the pillar of essence, the elemental pole of earth is a masive untra high supervolcano that is always erupting earth essence, things like that.<br /> <br /> Multielemental interactions in the connective lands: those manifestations in the land and sky are many, like forest of flame leaves in the wood fire coonection, or rivers and lakes that float in the sky when you travel through water-wind, this is mostly imagination.<br /> <br /> Issues drawing this monster: i really dont know how to represent the connection between a conective land and the elemental pole, i explain myself, the conective land is cilindric, but the elemental pole isnt in its base, because is more like a pillar, so, where should be each point of the final edge of the cilindric conective land in the flat draw of the elemental pole? Its a waypoint problem because if what you do is just make the cilinder a flat land and connect it to the elemental pole, you will end with a wormhole on the vertices of the cilinder map, making people travel hundreds of miles instantly thorugh the elemental pole with just walking a bit in the conective land.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":278,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/278-elyon","user":"Elyon","date":". 12-05-2015, 07:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/278-elyon","name":"Elyon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar278_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"149"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T02:11:55-08:00","id":815965,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"http://i36.photobucket.com/albums/e14/Eldagusto/Lahit_3.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> I would be honored if the map I am working on for my campaign would have a final draft by you. The details in my map are approximations so the shapes and minor islands and what not would be free to reimagine by you if you find something else more to your liking. Your maps are hella cool!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T05:48:36-08:00","id":816037,"title":"","content":"I can do a touch of cartography myself, but nothing near your calibre with The Photoshoops.<br /> <br /> So, I come on bended knee to ask of your aid, because your work is really bitchin awesome.<br /> <br /> Could you perhaps do the Dreaming Sea region? Showing at least Ysyr and the Northern coast? And some of Khamthahar? I've got a game I set there and desperately need some locales and life breathed into it, so you're entirely off the leash beyond those requests; experiment however you like with it, add as many little islands you think you can squeeze into the Dreaming Sea and fluff them however you want <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I saw someone offer services in return, so I make the same offer, whatever you want in written form, I can and will attempt to provide in return. Heck, I'll do it even if you don't take the job. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T14:08:15-08:00","id":816417,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elyon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=780490#post780490\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry for my delay, college is hard to handle.<br /> <br /> *complex description*</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh wow. I'm afraid that's a bit beyond my skills for the time being.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=815965#post815965\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><img src=\"http://i36.photobucket.com/albums/e14/Eldagusto/Lahit_3.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> I would be honored if the map I am working on for my campaign would have a final draft by you. The details in my map are approximations so the shapes and minor islands and what not would be free to reimagine by you if you find something else more to your liking. Your maps are hella cool!</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for the compliment. I'll give it a go once I'm done with my current projects!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arian Dynas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=816037#post816037\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can do a touch of cartography myself, but nothing near your calibre with The Photoshoops.<br /> <br /> So, I come on bended knee to ask of your aid, because your work is really bitchin awesome.<br /> <br /> Could you perhaps do the Dreaming Sea region? Showing at least Ysyr and the Northern coast? And some of Khamthahar? I've got a game I set there and desperately need some locales and life breathed into it, so you're entirely off the leash beyond those requests; experiment however you like with it, add as many little islands you think you can squeeze into the Dreaming Sea and fluff them however you want <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I saw someone offer services in return, so I make the same offer, whatever you want in written form, I can and will attempt to provide in return. Heck, I'll do it even if you don't take the job. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Not sure yet. I'll think about it? The thing is, while adding things to the Dreaming Sea is always cool and all, that's pretty much all I'd have to do there : redraw (and add details) to a map that I already find pretty gorgeous and epic on its own. Not saying no right now, but I'll see. Don't worry, I'll keep you posted!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T19:52:54-08:00","id":816611,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LeTipex</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=816417#post816417\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh wow. I'm afraid that's a bit beyond my skills for the time being.<br /> <br /> <br /> Thanks for the compliment. I'll give it a go once I'm done with my current projects!<br /> <br /> <br /> Not sure yet. I'll think about it? The thing is, while adding things to the Dreaming Sea is always cool and all, that's pretty much all I'd have to do there : redraw (and add details) to a map that I already find pretty gorgeous and epic on its own. Not saying no right now, but I'll see. Don't worry, I'll keep you posted!</div> </div> </div> </div>Well what you see is I have a problem.<br /> <br /> I look at a map, and see a map, rather than the landscape.<br /> <br /> So, my problem is I look at the 3rd Ed map and don't see the tons and tons of islands that are almost assuredly dotting it, all the size of small backyards or maybe a bit bigger, when those are a high seas adventurer's bread and butter.<br /> <br /> Basically, I am asking that you be my Google Earth and help me realize the vast quantity of islands I logically know are there, even if I can't see them otherwise. Does that make sense?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-05T10:07:28-08:00","id":842622,"title":"","content":"And here is TheCountAlucard's map of the Neck and Solid Shell :<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://tipexleloup.deviantart.com/art/The-Neck-or-Okeanos-594790776\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://img04.deviantart.net/dfdd/i/2016/065/c/f/the_neck_or_okeanos_by_tipexleloup-d9u4fi0.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a><br /> <br /> As usual, click on the map to be carried away to deviantart, where you can dl the original file.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-05T12:19:29-08:00","id":842675,"title":"","content":"Just perfect - thanks, LeTipex!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-05T14:23:29-08:00","id":842726,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LeTipex</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/158992-maps-and-cake-but-mostly-maps?p=816417#post816417\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh wow. I'm afraid that's a bit beyond my skills for the time being.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> So Sad, and now that I almost solved the waypoint problem u_u.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/278-elyon","name":"Elyon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar278_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"149"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-21T03:10:25-07:00","id":850475,"title":"","content":"Starting work on Eldagusto's map.<br /> <br /> In the meantime, here's another map of Maruba.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://tipexleloup.deviantart.com/art/Carte-de-Maruba-2-597874968\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://img08.deviantart.net/6eaf/i/2016/080/a/0/carte_de_maruba__2__by_tipexleloup-d9vyja0.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":541,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","user":"LeTipex","date":". 03-21-2016, 06:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theony