 to see it in deviantart and download the full version!<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> As I said above, I'm re-starting this thread, so if people want a map, post here to ask about it! (Since it's been so long, I assume most of what people have asked a year or two ago isn't still relevant, until they ask it again.) I'm currently doing one for my own game, plus one for Raemus and probably Brillant Rain, and work and life tend to conspire not to leave me much time to do artwork,so I won't be taking a dozen commands at a time (I tried doing that and pretty much burned out once)<br /> <br /> But two or three is plenty fine!</div> </div> </div> </div>oh this is very cool, i noticed you used arabic letters, is it supposed to say anything or is it for aesthetics? i only ask because i noticed the letters weren't connected and wanted to offer some help if you needed it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"> <div align=\"left\">Elemental and dragon line descriptors and capturing device coming soon</div> <div align=\"left\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1131843-my-own-take-on-a-craft-rewrite-that-inclu\" target=\"_blank\">Craft Rewrite </a> W/ Points, Slots, and Charms</div> <div align=\"left\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1106793-2nd-circle-demon-c-al-siphar-soc-initiation-symbiosis-of-the-burning-heart-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Demon Adversaries and Related Sorcerous Initiation</a></div> <div align=\"left\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1091536-seeking-thoughts-and-suggestions-on-constructing-an-organization-in-game-specifically-a-university\" target=\"_blank\">Executive Leadership</a> Organization Merrit</div> <hr /></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1990-norraba","name":"norraba","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpat